<title>THAILAND: Thai Farmers Bank Q3 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank Q3 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>Shr</p>
<p>(baht) 3.98 3.71</p>
<p>    Net		    3,182.95		  2,966.42</p>
<p>NOTES: Thai Farmers Bank did not give the profit figure for the nine-month period.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
